+	 * copied from described a PWM fan and claimed PH17 twice: once as
+	 * "pwms = <&pwm 0 ...>" (PWM channel 0 muxes out on PH17) and once as
+	 * "fg-gpio" for the tachometer. Driving a PWM onto PH17 would push an
+	 * output against the fan's open-collector tach line and destroy the
+	 * only speed feedback this board has, so every PWM property is gone:
+	 * pwms, pwm-names, pwm_ids, pwm_period_ns, default-duty and the
